%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0ca23d3e41cd5424c9ec72c610ef25a4, type: 3}
  m_Name: mdm_Day1_End
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  autoFocusSpeaker: 1
  screens:
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: With that, the two of us depart from the clubroom and make our way home.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475098267418702
    - rid: 8612954527079858319
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: The whole way, my mind wanders back and forth between the four girls.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8612954643173736698
    - rid: 8612954643173736699
    - rid: 8612954643173736700
    - rid: 8612954643173736701
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Will I be happy spending my afternoons with them?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: What if I get cooties?!?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8612954643173736702
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Heh.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 8612954643173736703
    - rid: 8612954643173736704
    - rid: 8612954643173736705
    - rid: 8612954643173736706
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I've spent the last hour taking care of the little bit of homework we
      were assigned today.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475089592287318
    - rid: 9079475098267418703
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I used to procrastinate more in middle school, but my post-homework gaming
      sessions feel WAY better.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: That, and I felt a lot more anxiety back then, which was mostly a result
      of my procrastination.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: But now, I'm free to game as I wish! Let's open up Allen's DMs and-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I have to write a poem.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Ah... poo.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Well, I guess I'll do that first. Then the gaming!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Alright, let's see what I got so far.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475098267418704
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475098267418705
    - rid: 4972360475574796343
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Dang it.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475098267418706
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Thirty minutes gone, with nothing to show for them.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: What should I do...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Oh, I know.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I pick up my phone and head to my contacts.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4972360475574796344
    - rid: 9079475098267418707
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: '{mc}?'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475098267418708
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Hey, I need some help with writing my poem for tomorrow.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: You're actually writing one? I figured you'd put it off until the last
      minute like <Speed=2>always~</Speed>.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475098267418709
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Quit being a punk and just give some advice, would you?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Well, what part do you need help with?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475098267418710
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: I'm having trouble getting started. Like, I'd be able to write it if
      I just knew what it'd be about, if that makes any sense.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Ohh... Well, you should try looking around your room and see if anything
      really stands out.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Look around my room?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Yeah, you don't need to write about anything hard, like the meaning of
      life, so you can just write about something you've got lying around.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475098267418711
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: But how am I supposed to write a poem about something so ordinary?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: That's the fun part~! You get to decide the meaning of the object.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Hmm. I guess you're right. Thanks, Sayori.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475098267418712
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: You're welcome.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Hey, {mc}?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475098267418713
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Yeah?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Why'd you ask <i>me</i> for help?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Well, since you seemed so excited about sharing poems, I figured you'd
      actually know your stuff.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: And I was right.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475098267418714
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Thanks, {mc}.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475098267418715
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: No problem. See ya 'round.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Byee~!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Alright. Something around my room...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 9079475098267418716
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I slowly spin around in my swivel seat, taking in my room.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Why do I have a projector just lying on my shelf?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I guess that'll be what my poem's about.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Time to get a-writin' once again...
    ScreenActions: []
